## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Severity | Mitigation |
|------|----------|------------|
| ClickHouse Cloud cost exceeds budget | MEDIUM | Start with smallest tier. Monitor usage. Self-host fallback at $2K/mo threshold |
| NATS message loss | LOW | JetStream durable consumers + R=3 replication |
| Dashboard performance on large datasets | MEDIUM | Materialized views pre-aggregate. Paginate queries. Add date range filters |
| WorkOS integration complexity | LOW | AuthKit is well-documented. Fallback: simple JWT if WorkOS is too complex |
| mTLS certificate management | MEDIUM | Auto-rotate certs. Fallback: API key auth for Phase 2 MVP |

## Security Considerations

- mTLS between CLI and cloud (device certificates)
- Row-level tenant isolation in ClickHouse
- JWT auth for dashboard API (WorkOS-issued tokens)
- No PII stored: developer_id is blake3 hash of email
- All data in transit: TLS 1.3
- ClickHouse data at rest: encrypted (cloud-managed keys)

